    "title": "Xi urges youth, students' federations to deepen reform, innovation for new achievements_英语频道_央视网(cctv.com)",
    "text": "Source:Xinhua 02-07-25 05:13 Updated BJT Font size: A+ A- BEIJING, July 2 (Xinhua) -- Chinese President Xi Jinping has called on youth and students' federations to adhere to the right political orientation, deepen reform and innovation, and under the Party's leadership, score new achievements on the new journey.\nXi, also general secretary of the Communist Party of China Central Committee and chairman of the Central Military Commission, made the remarks in a congratulatory letter to a session of the All-China Youth Federation and a congress of the All-China Students' Federation, which opened in Beijing Wednesday morning.",
